2:T4c2,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice","headline":"Santa Voice for Xmas Party Fireworks","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Guy Harris provided his tried and tested Santa voice for a Christmas Party Fireworks event run by the incredible company, Pyro Productions. Find out more!","datePublished":"2018-12-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2018-12-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["father christmas pyro"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice.jpg"}}3:T424,<h2>Santa Voiceover for a Christmas Party!</h2>
<p>Despite Santa's mythical status, most of us have a very strong idea of what Santa sounds like. His voice is round, deep, and jolly! Santa is too busy at Christmastime to do his own voiceover for every single event, so he lets me jump on a few of the jobs for him... I've provided my <a href="/santa-voice" target="_blank" title="Santa Voiceover">Santa voiceover</a> more times than I can count, but never for a firework's display! Needless to say, I love how this all came together. If you'd like another couple of examples of my Santa voice, check out my <a href="/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZEwMyp2Z530" target="_blank" title="GoJetters Santa">GoJetters Santa voiceover</a> (the BBC used me as the voice of Santa on their kid's show!).
<br>If you're hosting a bigger live event or awards night and need a powerful announcer voice, my 
<a href="/voice-of-god" class="isred" title="Voice of God Announcer">Voice of God</a> delivery is used by ITV, The Masked Singer, Butlins and major UK brands.
</p>7:["slug","christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice","d"]
0:["-I7cAKaR5Wzfc67K4RiE3",[[["",{"children":[["slug","christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice\"}",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":[["slug","christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[[["$","script","schema-0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script","schema-1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"News & Blog\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Santa Voice for Xmas Party Fireworks\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice\"}]}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Santa Voice for Xmas Party Fireworks"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Another opportunity to show off my Santa VoiceOver skills at a Live event.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main one-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],false,false]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice.jpg","alt":"christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A Little More About Pyro</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"/https://www.matthewsbrospyro.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Matthews Bros Pyro\">Matthews Bros Pyro</a> are a brilliant professional fireworks company based in Shropshire. They produce stunning displays for weddings, parties, corporate events and major celebrations across the UK. I’ve worked with them for years and their attention to detail is superb.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you're planning a Christmas event, firework show or party, and you need Santa to introduce the big moment, you can also check out my \r\n<a href=\"/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/the-official-voice-of-santa\" class=\"isred\" title=\"Official Voice of Santa\">Official Voice of Santa</a> page for more examples.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Need help writing a script for Santa? Try my \r\n<a href=\"/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/santa-script-generator\" class=\"isred\" title=\"Santa Script Generator\">Santa Script Generator</a>, it creates instant, personalised scripts you can use for any Christmas event.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in Touch</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you can't get hold of Santa to provide voiceover for your next big \r\n<a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> or project, I might be the next best thing. \r\nChristmas is a busy time, and I’m voicing Santa scripts daily, but I always make time for new projects.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you'd like to work with me, <a href=\"/contact-guy\" class=\"isred\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch here</a>. \r\nI’ve got plenty of Santa voice examples across my site, and if you need something tailored, \r\nI’m happy to record a bespoke sample from your script.\r\n</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"Santa Voice for Xmas Party Fireworks","pageUrl":"christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L4","920",{"href":"/just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice.jpg","alt":"just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Just Eat UEFA Football Commentator"}]]}],["$","$L4","519",{"href":"/minecraft-combat-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/minecraft-combat-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Minecraft Combat Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Minecraft Combat Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L4","695",{"href":"/greedy-granny-tv-commercial","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/greedy-granny-tv-commercial.jpg","alt":"Greedy Granny TV Commercial","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Greedy Granny TV Commercial"}]]}]]}]}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L6",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","$7","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L8",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]